- id: C:reliance/json-written
  type: reliance
  name: JSON as written
  summary: 'JSON is written on one line with ", " between items and ": " after keys; every character outside ASCII
    is written as a backslash, u and four lowercase hex digits (a pair of them for a character beyond U+FFFF), and
    control characters likewise, except the short escapes for quote, backslash, line feed, carriage return, tab,
    backspace and form feed; numbers are written as in the entry on numbers written as text; not-a-number and the
    infinities are written NaN, Infinity and -Infinity.'
  stance: observed
  'on': runtime
  gives: 'JSON is written on one line with ", " between items and ": " after keys; every character outside ASCII
    is written as a backslash, u and four lowercase hex digits (a pair of them for a character beyond U+FFFF), and
    control characters likewise, except the short escapes for quote, backslash, line feed, carriage return, tab,
    backspace and form feed; numbers are written as in the entry on numbers written as text; not-a-number and the
    infinities are written NaN, Infinity and -Infinity.'
  example: 'a name "café" with 3 is written {"café" written as "café": 3}; a time 1.5 is written 1.5.'
  stated:
