    keeps its last value; anything else is refused with a decoding error, a kind of value error.
  stance: observed
  'on': runtime
  gives: JSON is read with white space (space, tab, line feed, carriage return) allowed around values; a number
    without a fraction or an exponent becomes a whole number of any size, exactly, any other a fractional number;
    NaN, Infinity and -Infinity are accepted; a raw control character inside a string is refused; a key given twice
    keeps its last value; anything else is refused with a decoding error, a kind of value error.
