- id: C:reliance/home-and-tilde
  type: reliance
  name: the home folder and ~
  summary: The home folder is the HOME variable when it is set, else the account's entry in the system's password
    database.
  stance: observed
  'on': platform
  gives: The home folder is the HOME variable when it is set, else the account's entry in the system's password
    database. A path beginning with ~ has it replaced by the home folder (a trailing slash of the home dropped),
    and ~user by that account's home; a user the system does not know is refused with an error saying the home folder
